{"id":18364,"name":"Butler County","slug":"butler-county","state":"Pennsylvania","code":"PA","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/pennsylvania-tax-deeds/butler-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-20T14:52:38","facts":null,"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"YNtlT1E5jZXM03RdILKaAwc\"><iframe title=\"Is Buying Properties at 40-90% Off Real? - Butler County - Ohio Tax Lien &amp; Deed Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Qs55j4XRRn0?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Get-Low-Cost-Properties-in-Tax-Auctions!---Butler-County---Pennsylvania-Tax-Deed-Sale\">Get Low-Cost Properties in Tax Auctions in Butler  County, Pennsylvania</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Discover how you can secure properties for up to 90% below market value through three distinct tax sales in Butler County, <a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/pennsylvania-tax-deeds/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Pennsylvania</mark></a>: Upset, Judicial, and Repository.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If you&#8217;re looking to invest in real estate at a fraction of the market price, Butler County&#8217;s tax sales offer a fantastic opportunity. These sales allow you to purchase properties for as much as 90% off their usual value, making it a smart investment for those looking to enter the real estate market with minimal initial capital.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Understanding-the-Tax-Sales\">Understanding the Butler County Tax Sales</h2>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Upset-Sale\">Upset Sale</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>The Upset Sale is the first opportunity to purchase properties with delinquent taxes. The Butler County Tax Claim Bureau manages this sale, which occurs annually on the second Monday of September. Properties sold here still carry existing liens, for which the buyer must assume responsibility. Be sure to register at least 10 days in advance to participate.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Judicial-Sale\">Judicial Sale</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>In Butler County, if properties remain unsold after the Upset Sale, they move to the Judicial Sale, which typically occurs in March. A courtroom conducts these sales, and properties sell free and clear of previous liens, providing buyers with a cleaner title. You must complete registration for this sale 10 days prior.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Repository-Sale\">Repository Sale</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>Properties that are not sold during the Judicial Sale are placed in the Repository List and are available for over-the-counter purchase. These properties can be bid on at any time and are sold free of previous liens, providing a straightforward transaction process.</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Butler-County-Pennsylvania.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Butler-County-Pennsylvania-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Butler-County-Pennsylvania-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Butler-County-Pennsylvania-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Butler-County-Pennsylvania-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Butler-County-Pennsylvania-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Butler-County-Pennsylvania.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Butler-County-Pennsylvania.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Butler-County-Pennsylvania-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Butler-County-Pennsylvania-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Butler-County-Pennsylvania-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Butler-County-Pennsylvania-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Butler-County-Pennsylvania-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-18371 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Butler County, Pennsylvania\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-here-s-a-quick-overview-of-the-key-details-and-helpful-links-for-butler-county-tax-sales\">Here&#8217;s a quick overview of the key details and helpful links for Butler County tax sales:</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><th><strong>Detail</strong></th><th><strong>Information</strong></th></tr><tr><td><strong>Tax Sale Types</strong></td><td>Upset Sale, Judicial Sale, Repository Sale</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Typical Sale Dates</strong></td><td>Upset Sale: Second Monday of September; Judicial Sale: Typically March; Repository Sale: Ongoing</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Registration Requirement</strong></td><td>Must register at least 10 days prior to the sale</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Payment Method</strong></td><td>Payments must be made immediately using cash, money order, cashier’s check, certified check, or a local attorney’s check</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Auction Sites</strong></td><td>UL Conference Room for Upset Sale; Courtroom for Judicial Sale</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Contact Information</strong></td><td><a href=\"https://www.butlercountypa.gov/356/Tax-Claim-Bureau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Tax Claim Bureau</mark></a>, <a href=\"https://www.butlercountypa.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Butler County Official Website</mark></a>,<br><a href=\"https://www.butlercountypa.gov/390/Property-Tax-Information\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">County Property Tax Information</mark></a></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Key Resources</strong></td><td><a href=\"https://www.butlercountypa.gov/DocumentCenter/View/6878/Terms-and-Conditions-for-Judicial-Sale\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Terms and Conditions for Judicial Sale</mark></a>, <a href=\"https://www.butlercountypa.gov/DocumentCenter/View/3450/Terms-and-Conditions-of-the-Upset-Tax-SalePDF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Terms and Conditions of the Upset Tax Sale</mark></a>, <a href=\"https://www.butlercountypa.gov/DocumentCenter/View/725/Repository-Terms-and-Conditions-PDF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Repository Terms and Conditions</mark></a></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips\">Pro Tips in Butler County Tax Deed Investing</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research Thoroughly</strong>: Understand all the details and conditions before bidding in Butler County. This includes checking for any additional liens or legal issues.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Inspect Properties</strong>: Visit and inspect properties before the sale whenever possible.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Legal Consultation in Butler County</strong>: Consider consulting with a real estate attorney to navigate any complex legal aspects.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Need-a-Hand?\">Need a Hand?</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>If you have more questions or need guidance to get started in Butler County, feel free to reach out. You can <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inlin